om 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 47% of normal in November to December, and in 2026 so far March to April came in at 48%. Grids 19092 and 19093 had their driest year in 1988, at 65% of normal.</p>"}
